#NEXUS

[ de Souza et al. 2021, Scientific Reports 11: 22281, Fig. 6: time-calibrated tree of Ceratosauria/Noasauridae, rectangular, root left, with thick range bars on terminal branches, a coloured Triassic-Cretaceous timescale strip and a collapsed Abelisauridae wedge; about 20 tips. 19 tips. Abelisauridae is a collapsed wedge and keeps its printed text; "Vespersaurus (holotype)" is Vespersaurus_hol in the matrix. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node against the image (2026-10-27); topology only, no support values. Licence: CC BY 4.0; see attribution.txt. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=19;
    TAXLABELS
        Herrerasaurus
        Megapnosaurus
        Dilophosaurus
        Allosaurus
        Berberosaurus
        Genyodectes
        Ceratosaurus
        Berthasaura
        Deltadromeus
        Afromimus
        Velocisaurus
        Vespersaurus_hol
        Noasaurus
        Masiakasaurus
        MNNtig6
        Limusaurus
        Elaphrosaurus
        CCG20011
        Abelisauridae
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE desouza2021a_fig6 = [&R] (Herrerasaurus,(Megapnosaurus,(Dilophosaurus,(Allosaurus,(Berberosaurus,((Genyodectes,Ceratosaurus),((Berthasaura,(Deltadromeus,(Afromimus,Velocisaurus,Vespersaurus_hol,Noasaurus,Masiakasaurus,(MNNtig6,(Limusaurus,(Elaphrosaurus,CCG20011)))))),Abelisauridae)))))));
END;
